From: apklayer <noreply@apklayer.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] apklayer patch: FRECPE/FRSQRTE return the architectural 8-bit estimate

The interpreter computed the exact 1/x and 1/sqrt(x) (the lite and heavy translators likewise), hardware returns the estimate of the ARM ARM FPRecipEstimate /
FPRSqrtEstimate (9-bit table index, 8 fraction bits). New interpreter/arm64/fp_estimate.h computes them bit-exactly (f16, f32, f64, scalar and vector); the lite and
heavy translators now bail to the interpreter for these instructions. DN/FZ/RMode of the estimate are not honoured. Module libberberis_arm64.

